      "description": "The console's own bios, dumped from a PlayStation 2 you own. This project asks for Japan v1.00 (2000-01-17), which is the dump usually called ps2-0100j-20000117.bin. Another dump of the same release will do; a different release is a different machine, and the Boot ROM setting is where to say so.",
